## Remove invented additions safely
- Do not delete unreviewed components elsewhere in the repository; this branch only adds navigation and source copies. Existing content has different ownership/provenance.
- Identify any assistant-invented text or unsupported claims in a separate diff report with paths and evidence. Propose deletion **only** for identified assistant-authored additions after confirming the user-authored original remains.
- Keep the difference between live browser simulation and real-world printers, robotic agents and NASA equipment clear. Do not claim industrial self-replication, verified sentience or live physical manufacturing.
- Do not add generic filler, imaginary historical facts, fabricated dimensions, invented book counts, random humans, or unsolicited editorial reinterpretations.

